\par\par \b \uc2 EXCHANGE --- \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  Plans to Fire Unvaccinated Workers\b0\par\par\uc2 By David Benoit \par \uc2 294 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 January 2022\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B11\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Citigroup Inc\uc2  . told its U.S. staff it planned to follow through on previous warnings and would terminate unvaccinated employees in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 The New York bank reminded staff they had one more week, until Jan. 14, to get vaccinated. After that, the bank told employees, anyone who is still unvaccinated will be placed on unpaid leave, according to people familiar with the matter. Their employment would terminate on Jan. 31, the people said.\par \par \uc2 Nearly 95% of the bank's U.S. employees are now vaccinated, one of the people said. The figure has been rising and is expected to keep going higher, the people said. The bank is allowing religious and medical exemptions for employees, and is following local laws.\par \par \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  has also offered carrots to go with its mandate stick. It offered a $200 bonus to entice employees to submit vaccination proof by early December and has held sessions with doctors and experts to try to assuage concerns.\par \par \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  issued the mandate with the Jan. 14 deadline at the end of October, after the Biden administration said government contractors would be required to enforce vaccination mandates.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration's mandate has been winding its way through courts.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  is a key client for the bank, which works for the Treasury Department issuing U.S. bonds and processes U.S. passport applications. The bank has about 65,000 U.S. employees.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg News earlier reported on \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  's messaging.\par \par \uc2 Other big banks have imposed some levels of vaccine requirements, but only for workers to come into the office. \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  Chief Executive \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2  , for one, has publicly said the bank is concerned about legal ramifications from requiring the vaccine.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020220108ei1800030\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
