\par\par \uc2 The Property Report\par \b \uc2 Pandemic Fuels West Palm Beach Office Market\b0\par\par\uc2 By Konrad Putzier \par \uc2 606 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 December 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B6\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 An influx of financial firms from New York and other locations is fueling an office-leasing boom and new development in West Palm Beach, Fla.\par \par \uc2 Related Cos. said Tuesday that it plans to build two office properties in the city with a price tag of about $750 million.\par \par \uc2 The two projects and two other Related developments are set to increase the total office space in the city's central business district by more than 50% to 4.3 million square feet, from 2.8 million square feet last year, according to data from \uc2 CBRE Group Inc\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 West Palm Beach has long been overshadowed by the richer and more famous Palm Beach to the east. It never had much office space, partly because finance professionals visited only on weekends or for a few weeks during the winter, returning to their New York offices by the spring. "You came here in the summer and it was a different market than the winter," said Related's chairman, \uc2 Stephen Ross\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The pandemic is starting to change that. With their offices closed for months, many finance professionals moved to South Florida to work remotely. Meanwhile, the pandemic pushed more companies to rethink their office strategy and open outposts in places where taxes and housing costs are lower, such as Florida. West Palm Beach is also benefiting from a new rail line to downtown Miami that opened in 2018.\par \par \uc2 "People can telecommute now and it's more widely acceptable," said John Criddle, an executive vice president at CBRE. He said he has never seen the leasing market this busy and expects the city's office sector to double over the next few years.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs Group Inc\uc2 . and investment firm \uc2 Elliott Management Corp\uc2 . have signed leases at a recently completed Related development in West Palm Beach. Gopal Rajegowda, a partner at Related, said that 75% of the West Palm Beach office space it leased out over the past 18 months went to companies new to the city.\par \par \uc2 Florida overall has benefited from business relocations during the pandemic. Miami has been attracting both financial and technology companies from high-tax states like New York and California.\par \par \uc2 New York-based Related, best known for developing the Hudson Yards neighborhood in Manhattan, has a long history of building in South Florida and has been active in West Palm Beach for decades. Mr. Ross is also the owner of the \uc2 Miami Dolphins\uc2  football team.\par \par \uc2 Related's two new West Palm Beach projects, designed by Arquitectonica and \uc2 Kohn Pedersen Fox Associates\uc2 , would span around 450,000 square feet each and include offices, retail space and a theater. The company is applying for a rezoning to build the projects and, if successful, plans to complete them in three years.\par \par \uc2 Related is also developing a 25-story office tower designed by \uc2 David Childs\uc2 , and it bought three West Palm Beach office properties and two senior-housing projects this year, cementing its position as the dominant private landlord in the city center. The firm would control close to 4 million square feet of real estate -- including nearly 2.5 million square feet of office space -- in West Palm Beach once the two latest projects are completed.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Ross traced the growing demand for office space in West Palm Beach to the early months of the pandemic. "People came down here and stayed until sometime in June, July before they went north again, and they saw what Florida was like during those months," he said. "I think that opened up a whole dynamic that didn't exist before."\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020211222ehcm00015\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
