\par\par \b \uc2 EXCHANGE --- Blackstone Nears Deal For New York Skyscraper --- Trophy property given a value of $2.85 billion\b0\par\par\uc2 By Peter Grant \par \uc2 604 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 December 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B1\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Blackstone Inc\uc2 . is in advanced talks to acquire a 49% stake in a new Manhattan office tower in a deal that values the skyscraper at $2.85 billion, providing a shot of confidence for New York during tough times.\par \par \uc2 A venture led by \uc2 Brookfield Asset Management\uc2  could reach an agreement to sell the stake in the One Manhattan West property to Blackstone in the next few days, people familiar with the matter said.\par \par \uc2 A deal would be the latest sign that the Covid-19 pandemic and even the spread of the Omicron variant aren't deterring investors from paying top dollar for the most-modern and highest-quality office buildings. The stake in the office tower would fetch one of the highest prices ever paid for New York office property, according to brokers and real-estate investors.\par \par \uc2 Investors are paying up for trophy office buildings despite higher office vacancy rates overall. Tenants are gravitating toward these buildings as they try to coax employees who have been working from home for over 20 months back to the office. Businesses say that great views, cool amenities and state-of-the-art air-filtration systems have helped them overcome resistance from employees who became used to their new working patterns.\par \par \uc2 Brookfield and its partner, \uc2 Qatar Investment Authority\uc2 , opened the 2.1-million-square-foot building in 2019 with features including a 2.5-acre plaza lined by restaurants and stores. Located across the street from the new Moynihan Train Hall, it is over 90% leased by such tenants as law firm \uc2 Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher & Flom\uc2 , consulting firm \uc2 Accenture PLC\uc2  and the \uc2 National Hockey League\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The success of One Manhattan West and other new developments such as nearby One Vanderbilt comes as concern is growing over the future of more-ordinary office buildings. The share prices of office real-estate investment trusts are down an average of about 15% since the pandemic, according to real-estate analytics firm Green Street.\par \par \uc2 Many businesses are saying that when they do return employees to offices they will do so on a hybrid basis, meaning they will continue to allow employees to work some days at home. Some companies are delaying return dates because of the new Omicron variant of the Covid-19 virus.\par \par \uc2 Office leasing has also been depressed. Before Omicron appeared, brokers and other market participants were hoping that leasing would return to pre-pandemic levels by the end of next year. "It now seems that perhaps that gets pushed back as well," said Daniel Ismail, a Green Street analyst.\par \par \uc2 New trophy buildings such as One Manhattan West have apparently avoided the pain. Before the pandemic, \uc2 Brian Kingston\uc2 , chief executive of Brookfield's Real Estate Group, estimated at an investor presentation that the 67-story office tower was worth $2.9 billion, almost exactly the valuation in the imminent Blackstone deal.\par \par \uc2 One Manhattan West is part of an 8-acre development by Brookfield and Qatar Investment Authority that includes the Pendry Manhattan West hotel, which opened this year, and a luxury rental apartment building that opened in 2017.\par \par \uc2 Brookfield put One Manhattan West up for sale in September through a \uc2 Cushman & Wakefield\uc2  team led by Doug Harmon and Adam Spies. The team represented Brookfield in its 2017 sale of a 49% stake of its office tower at One Liberty Plaza -- also to Blackstone -- in a deal that valued that tower at over $1.5 billion.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg earlier reported that Brookfield was exploring a possible sale of One Manhattan West.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020211218ehci0002q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
