\par\par \b \uc2 OFF DUTY --- Style & Fashion: How to Play the Sock Market --- That chill in the air means sock season is upon us. And if you spent last winter working from home in pilled, worn-through Smartwools, it's time to step up your sock game. Here, Rebecca Malinsky offers a crash course in women's shoe-hosiery combinations, highlighting six slick, fail-safe pairings.\b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 December 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par D2\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Enliven Loafers\par \par \uc2 Generations of dapper gents have paired their cobbled soles with a red trouser sock. Adopt and adapt this classic menswear look by teaming your loafers with a bright pink cotton version, like this pair from Comme Si. Jeans (throughout), $90, Levi.com; Socks, $28, CommeSi.com; Loafers, $405, HereuStudio.com\par \par \uc2 Ground Snazzy Sandals\par \par \uc2 Yes, you wore wool socks with your Birkenstocks in college. We advise bringing this exact combination back. Instead, upgrade both. Cashmere socks make a designer sandal feel less uppity, more ironic. Pants (throughout), $1,050, Celine, 212-535-3703; Socks, $70, LaurenManoogian.com; Sandals, $1,495, RogerVivier.com\par \par \uc2 Cultivate Contrast\par \par \uc2 A black sock might seem an unlikely mate for your crisp, classic Converse, but these opposites balance each other strikingly, making sure neither party steals all the attention. Socks, $21, Falke.com; Sneakers, $55, Converse.com\par \par \uc2 Give Gym Kicks Charisma\par \par \uc2 These days, gym-ready sneakers are common accompaniments for everything from a floral dress to a trim suit. Consider kicking your business-casual uniform up a notch by introducing a pop-color sock (like these turquoise ones). Socks, $35, BrotherVellies.com, Sneakers $120, Asics.com\par \par \uc2 Modernize Mocs\par \par \uc2 A moccasin could easily stear your look into camp territory, but with a kooky striped sock like this pair from Happy Socks, a country boot becomes quirkily casual and will fit in equally on a picnic and a city bus. Moccasins, $800, Toteme-Studio.com; Socks, $14, HappySocks.com\par \par \uc2 Play Up Pumps\par \par \uc2 There's something wonderfully retro about teaming a slim, single-sole stiletto with a sheer black stocking. Eighties fans in particular will appreciate this moody pairing, which emphasizes the ankle. Socks, $90, WolfordShop.com; Pumps, $745, GianvitoRossi.com\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020211204ehc40000b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
