\par\par \b \uc2 Business News: Times' Wirecutter Staffers Go On Strike\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rachel Wolfe \par \uc2 276 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 November 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Unionized staffers at \uc2 New York Times Co\uc2 .'s product-review website Wirecutter say they have gone on strike amid a contract stalemate with the paper's management.\par \par \uc2 Wirecutter staffers plan to strike through Nov. 29, which is Cyber Monday -- a popular online shopping day that comes days after Black Friday. The period is Wirecutter's busiest and most profitable of the year, said Nick Guy, the Wirecutter Union unit chair and a senior staff writer for the site.\par \par \uc2 "This is the time of the year that we really work for months and months and months," Mr. Guy said. "I think it is an appropriate time to really show the value that we do bring to the company."\par \par \uc2 The 65 union members participating in the strike represent 100% of the section's union-eligible workforce. The union says it is seeking wage increases that total about $300,000 in the first year.\par \par \uc2 Staffers are asking for a 2.5% guaranteed annual wage increase, and higher minimum salaries across four pay bands. So far, Times management has agreed to a 1% guaranteed annual increase plus the option for merit-based raises, Mr. Guy said.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 New York Times\uc2  has a long history of productive relationships with unions to advance our shared objectives," said \uc2 Danielle Rhoades Ha\uc2 , vice president of communications at the New York Times. "We're actively working with the Wirecutter Union to reach a collective bargaining agreement that continues to reward our employees for their work and contributions to the Times's success, and we look forward to continuing those negotiations at the bargaining table."\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020211126ehbq0000r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
